== Tips ==
* The Demon Bow (or its Crimson counterpart) will almost always be craftable after one [[Eye of Cthulhu]] kill, because it drops at least 30 [[Crimtane Ore|Crimtane]] or [[Demonite Ore]], which can be turned into 10 respective bars.

